      "project_id": 27821563,
      "title": "Meltano 2.0 Drop Campaign Planning",
      "description": "### Activity \n- What features do we have coming that could be considered OS features that ungates roadblock to begin DataOps OS.  \n- We can rally around this product capability / can crate launch around this- point at which it can now be scaled\n\n\n### Suggested moments\n- Meltano 2.0 - April / May\n- MeltanoHub as source of truth for OS - April / May\n- UI- Q3\n- API- things need to be more API driven behind the scenes (starts this month but will be a big process to get this fixed)\n- Run, enviro, stream maps- big tent pole features (big differentiators and point in DataOps OS direction)\n- If meltano manages your single sign on- there would need to be changes in those tools to support \n\n\n### Todos\n\n- [ ] pick moments that we want to highlight, package them as props (narratively), create camapign around them \n\n\n<!-- Labels to add for triaging -->\n~\"valuestream::Business Operation\" \n~\"kind::Non-Product\"",
